The application should feel like entering a small digital astronomical observatory.

Primary navigation:

Observe
Measure Time
Sun & Shadow
Moon & Calendar
Predict an Eclipse
Accuracy Lab
Sources

Do not build a conventional dashboard with dozens of cards.

The central visual simulation should dominate each screen.

