4. LANDING EXPERIENCE

The first screen should be exceptionally simple.

Minimal vector scene:

- horizon,
- rising Sun,
- small vertical śaṅku/gnomon,
- its shadow,
- a water-clock bowl,
- Moon above,
- sparse stars.

Main title:

Ghaṭikā

Subtitle:

Measure time. Read the sky. Predict an eclipse.

Primary button:

Enter the Observatory

Secondary:

How did this work?

As the user moves the pointer or device slightly, the Sun/shadow scene can respond with subtle parallax.

No photorealism.

No stock imagery.

Everything should be vector/SVG/CSS/canvas based.

