26. MOTION

Use subtle motion extensively where it teaches physics.

Examples:

Sun drifting
shadow rotating
water slowly filling bowl
bowl sinking
Moon orbiting
node crossing
eclipse discs converging
celestial sphere turning

The motion must communicate the phenomenon.

No pointless bouncing UI.

